# list.txt format — one account per line
#
#   email|password
#
# - The FIRST | separates email from password.
# - The password is EVERYTHING after the first | — it may contain |, \, @, &, etc.
#
# Optional trailing 2FA token (short numeric code, ≤8 digits, after a final |):
#   email|password|123456
#
# Examples:
#
#   user1@gmail.com|myP@ssw0rd
#   user2@gmail.com|pass-with|pipes-and\backslashes
#   user3@gmail.com|PlainPassword123
#   user4@gmail.com|realPassword|482103        <- 482103 is the 2FA token
#
# NOTE: if your password genuinely ENDS with "|" + digits, it will be read as 2FA.
# Avoid that, or edit so the password isn't numeric-after-a-final-bar.
